                                          5099  label('v6502_SBC')
                                          5100  # No matter how hard we try, v6502_SBC always comes out a lot clumsier
                                          5101  # than v6502_ADC. And that one already barely fits in 38 cycles and is
                                          5102  # hard to follow. So we use a hack: transmorph our SBC into an ADC with
                                          5103  # inverted operand, and then dispatch again. Simple and effective.
